WEBVTT

00:01:39.920 --> 00:01:41.050
Stealing supplies.

00:01:41.280 --> 00:01:42.320
Of course.

00:01:42.880 --> 00:01:44.080
Thank Brigade Commander Cui

00:01:44.080 --> 00:01:45.539
for bringing us this news.

00:01:45.720 --> 00:01:46.850
Go back and tell him,

00:01:47.000 --> 00:01:48.800
tell him it's just like last time.

00:01:48.800 --> 00:01:50.930
He gets the credit, and I get the goods.

00:01:56.440 --> 00:01:58.280
What goods do you want?

00:01:58.960 --> 00:02:00.120
Do you even need to ask?

00:02:00.120 --> 00:02:02.320
The weapons from the Japs, of course.

00:02:02.560 --> 00:02:03.520
As for the grain,

00:02:04.160 --> 00:02:05.600
however the Japs stole it,

00:02:05.600 --> 00:02:06.920
we'll return it the exact same way.

00:02:06.920 --> 00:02:07.640
Right.

00:02:10.560 --> 00:02:11.690
Just like last time,

00:02:12.120 --> 00:02:14.380
he's being greedy and wants everything.

00:02:15.880 --> 00:02:17.720
He asks me to team up against the Japs,

00:02:17.720 --> 00:02:19.520
yet he negotiates terms with me.

00:02:20.360 --> 00:02:21.760
What is he thinking?

00:02:24.600 --> 00:02:25.360
Commander,

00:02:25.600 --> 00:02:26.860
what should we do next?

00:02:30.240 --> 00:02:31.100
Remember this.

00:02:31.200 --> 00:02:33.200
We can't be short of food or weapons.

00:02:33.240 --> 00:02:34.760
If those bandits try to rob us,

00:02:34.760 --> 00:02:36.360
show them no mercy.

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:37.600
Yes.

00:02:44.240 --> 00:02:45.040
Brothers.

00:02:45.480 --> 00:02:46.960
There's an opportunity now

00:02:46.960 --> 00:02:48.360
to teach the Japs a lesson

00:02:48.640 --> 00:02:50.200
and from their hands,

00:02:50.360 --> 00:02:51.480
seize weapons.

00:02:51.880 --> 00:02:52.800
Are we doing it?

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:55.000
Yes, fight the Japs!

00:02:55.240 --> 00:02:56.920
Avenge our brothers!

00:02:57.120 --> 00:02:57.760
Alright.

00:02:58.640 --> 00:03:00.440
Brother, give the order.

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:02.050
We'll all listen to you.

00:03:05.240 --> 00:03:06.080
Alright.

00:03:07.840 --> 00:03:08.880
We got news.

00:03:09.440 --> 00:03:11.440
The Japanese are short on supplies.

00:03:11.560 --> 00:03:13.680
Lately, they've been sending small squads

00:03:13.680 --> 00:03:14.480
one by one

00:03:14.800 --> 00:03:17.260
to villages around the county to loot grain.

00:03:17.560 --> 00:03:19.200
If we set up an ambush in advance

00:03:19.200 --> 00:03:20.130
and attack them,

00:03:20.320 --> 00:03:21.520
we can snatch

00:03:21.720 --> 00:03:22.780
weapons from them.

00:03:22.880 --> 00:03:25.210
We can also return the grain to the people.

00:03:27.040 --> 00:03:29.520
Weren't we just worrying about having no weapons?

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:32.050
The Japanese are delivering them right to us.

00:03:33.280 --> 00:03:34.040
Master.

00:03:35.400 --> 00:03:37.120
The premise of an ambush

00:03:37.800 --> 00:03:40.600
is to figure out the exact route of the enemy.

00:03:41.480 --> 00:03:44.079
We need to find out which road the Japs will take

00:03:44.520 --> 00:03:45.880
and which village they will pass through.

00:03:45.880 --> 00:03:47.560
We need to know everything.

00:03:48.000 --> 00:03:48.660
Master Liu,

00:03:48.960 --> 00:03:51.040
you really are a veteran who has led troops.

00:03:51.040 --> 00:03:52.440
I have it all figured out.

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:53.760
Master Liu,

00:03:54.079 --> 00:03:55.240
you lead a team of swordsmen

00:03:55.240 --> 00:03:57.160
to the villages around the county town.

00:03:57.160 --> 00:03:58.720
As soon as you see Japs entering the village,

00:03:58.720 --> 00:03:59.720
send us a message.

00:03:59.920 --> 00:04:00.720
Okay.

00:04:01.160 --> 00:04:02.960
I will be Uncle Liu's assistant.

00:04:03.400 --> 00:04:04.160
Okay.

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:07.320
You are careful, so you can look after him.

00:04:07.720 --> 00:04:10.320
Then we will follow the rules of our swordsmen.

00:04:10.560 --> 00:04:11.800
Once we spot the Japs,

00:04:12.800 --> 00:04:13.840
we will send a smoke signal.

00:04:13.840 --> 00:04:14.520
Okay.

00:04:14.840 --> 00:04:16.040
Send a smoke signal.

00:04:16.399 --> 00:04:17.160
Master Liu,

00:04:17.519 --> 00:04:19.680
Master Liu and I will lead a team

00:04:19.760 --> 00:04:21.640
to the vicinity of the county town.

00:04:21.640 --> 00:04:22.900
Once we see the signal,

00:04:23.000 --> 00:04:25.060
we will lay an ambush at the location.

00:04:26.480 --> 00:04:27.320
Okay.

00:04:27.640 --> 00:04:28.970
Did everyone hear that?

00:04:29.280 --> 00:04:30.360
Get ready, everyone.

00:04:30.360 --> 00:04:31.280
Yes, sir.

00:04:31.680 --> 00:04:33.520
Go, go, go.

00:04:38.920 --> 00:04:39.720
Report.

00:04:40.120 --> 00:04:40.840
Come in.

00:04:43.200 --> 00:04:43.840
Brigade Commander,

00:04:43.840 --> 00:04:45.900
Cai Baozi sent a swordsman to see you.

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:47.600
Brigade Commander Cui,

00:04:47.600 --> 00:04:49.040
Boss Cai asked me to pass a message.

00:04:49.040 --> 00:04:50.840
He said to act when you see the smoke signal.

00:04:50.840 --> 00:04:53.320
If you're late, the prey will be taken away.

00:04:56.000 --> 00:04:56.600
Alright.

00:04:56.920 --> 00:04:58.380
Go back and tell your boss,

00:04:58.520 --> 00:05:00.680
I will be there as promised. I won't leave until we meet.

00:05:00.680 --> 00:05:03.080
Brigade Commander Cui, I'll take my leave.

00:05:04.600 --> 00:05:06.440
Notify the troops to get ready.

00:05:07.000 --> 00:05:09.240
Let's go up high and see the view.

00:05:09.440 --> 00:05:10.120
Yes.

00:05:22.000 --> 00:05:22.760
Uncle Liu.

00:05:23.320 --> 00:05:25.780
We've already been through three villages.

00:05:25.840 --> 00:05:28.000
Are the Japs not coming?

00:05:29.640 --> 00:05:31.400
No one can figure them out.

00:05:31.920 --> 00:05:33.850
Don't worry yet, let's look ahead.

00:05:35.560 --> 00:05:36.840
Miss, Master Liu.

00:05:37.200 --> 00:05:37.960
How is it?

00:05:38.800 --> 00:05:41.120
Saw the Japs entering Zhang Village ahead.

00:05:41.120 --> 00:05:42.120
Okay, hurry back.

00:05:42.360 --> 00:05:43.120
Keep an eye on them.

00:05:43.120 --> 00:05:43.480
Yes.

00:05:43.640 --> 00:05:44.840
Catch up quickly, go.

00:05:44.880 --> 00:05:45.600
Go.

00:05:59.920 --> 00:06:00.760
Stop.

00:06:01.400 --> 00:06:02.120
Good view here.

00:06:02.120 --> 00:06:02.720
Right here.

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:03.920
Unload all the grass.

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:07.010
Hurry up, make it quick.

00:06:19.680 --> 00:06:20.720
Hurry.

00:06:23.160 --> 00:06:24.490
Hurry up, make it quick.

00:06:26.440 --> 00:06:27.720
Everyone listen up.

00:06:28.240 --> 00:06:29.960
When we enter the village later,

00:06:29.960 --> 00:06:31.320
as soon as you see the Japs,

00:06:31.320 --> 00:06:32.320
follow my orders.

00:06:33.120 --> 00:06:35.240
Don't linger, finish the fight quickly.

00:06:35.240 --> 00:06:36.570
Protect the civilians.

00:06:36.920 --> 00:06:37.680
Yes, sir.

00:06:38.840 --> 00:06:39.640
Baozi,

00:06:40.240 --> 00:06:41.159
come here.

00:06:44.280 --> 00:06:45.880
Smoke is rising ahead.

00:06:46.440 --> 00:06:47.900
Judging by the direction,

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:49.720
it's from Mageta Village.

00:06:53.040 --> 00:06:53.880
Mr. Liu,

00:06:54.680 --> 00:06:56.280
you lead a team from the west,

00:06:56.400 --> 00:06:58.130
and I'll lead one from the east.

00:06:58.320 --> 00:07:00.080
We'll meet up outside Mageta Village

00:07:00.080 --> 00:07:01.080
in the woods later.

00:07:01.080 --> 00:07:01.920
Okay.

00:07:03.040 --> 00:07:03.920
Follow me.

00:07:04.600 --> 00:07:05.440
Brothers, follow me.

00:07:05.440 --> 00:07:06.040
Let's go.

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:07.050
Go. This way.

00:07:07.160 --> 00:07:08.080
Go. Go.

00:07:18.000 --> 00:07:19.000
They showed up.

00:07:19.240 --> 00:07:20.560
Commander, is it the Japanese

00:07:20.560 --> 00:07:21.680
or Cai Baozi?

00:07:22.240 --> 00:07:24.170
This road leads to Mageta Village.

00:07:24.440 --> 00:07:26.970
We absolutely can't make a losing deal today.

00:07:27.280 --> 00:07:28.440
Get the brothers ready.

00:07:28.440 --> 00:07:29.160
Yes, sir.

00:07:29.840 --> 00:07:31.880
Attention! Right face!

00:07:32.880 --> 00:07:33.680
Move out!

00:07:37.520 --> 00:07:38.580
Fellow villagers,

00:07:39.400 --> 00:07:40.659
the Imperial Army said

00:07:41.240 --> 00:07:43.440
as long as you hand over enough rations,

00:07:44.320 --> 00:07:46.650
they won't make things difficult for you.

00:07:48.080 --> 00:07:49.360
Please tell them.

00:07:49.640 --> 00:07:51.320
It's a year of famine.

00:07:51.960 --> 00:07:52.800
Our village

00:07:52.800 --> 00:07:55.280
had a hard time gathering this much grain.

00:07:55.640 --> 00:07:58.400
We even brought out next year's seeds.

00:07:58.840 --> 00:08:00.440
We really have nothing left.

00:08:03.800 --> 00:08:05.120
Tell them

00:08:05.440 --> 00:08:06.970
they must hand over enough,

00:08:07.080 --> 00:08:09.880
or none of them will leave alive.

00:08:10.080 --> 00:08:10.880
Yes, sir.

00:08:11.800 --> 00:08:14.000
Chief, the officer said

00:08:14.400 --> 00:08:16.400
if you don't hand over enough grain,

00:08:17.040 --> 00:08:18.400
none of you will live.

00:08:19.320 --> 00:08:20.920
We really have nothing left.

00:08:21.120 --> 00:08:22.320
Nothing left.

00:08:22.720 --> 00:08:24.400
What should we do?

00:08:24.720 --> 00:08:25.520
Exactly.

00:08:25.640 --> 00:08:26.480
What is this?

00:08:28.000 --> 00:08:29.460
Why hasn't he arrived yet?

00:08:30.920 --> 00:08:32.360
Master Liu, Miss.

00:08:32.760 --> 00:08:33.520
How is it?

00:08:35.120 --> 00:08:37.760
The Japanese devils are forcing the commoners to hand over food.

00:08:37.760 --> 00:08:39.880
If they don't hand over enough, none of them will survive.

00:08:39.880 --> 00:08:40.880
How many of them are there?

00:08:40.880 --> 00:08:41.720
Twenty or thirty.

00:08:41.720 --> 00:08:43.250
And they have machine guns.

00:08:43.320 --> 00:08:44.640
I'm not waiting anymore. Follow me.

00:08:44.640 --> 00:08:45.320
No.

00:08:46.320 --> 00:08:48.180
Uncle Liu, we can't be impulsive.

00:08:48.200 --> 00:08:48.800
Baozi said

00:08:48.920 --> 00:08:49.920
we are here to ambush,

00:08:49.920 --> 00:08:50.600
not to attack.

00:08:50.600 --> 00:08:52.400
We must follow his arrangement.

00:08:52.560 --> 00:08:53.760
I'm dying of anxiety.

00:08:55.440 --> 00:08:56.040
He's here.

00:08:56.160 --> 00:08:56.880
Brother, Ying'er.

00:08:56.880 --> 00:08:57.940
Master Liu, Baozi.

00:08:58.680 --> 00:08:59.880
The devils have already entered the village.

00:08:59.880 --> 00:09:01.880
The machine guns are already set up.

00:09:04.240 --> 00:09:05.640
Why is there still no sign

00:09:05.840 --> 00:09:06.800
of Cui Wenkui?

00:09:07.120 --> 00:09:09.050
Brother, we can't wait any longer.

00:09:09.200 --> 00:09:09.840
If we keep waiting,

00:09:09.840 --> 00:09:12.900
who knows how many more civilians these Japs will harm.

00:09:13.800 --> 00:09:15.120
Everyone, come here first.

00:09:15.120 --> 00:09:16.180
Come down quickly.

00:09:18.440 --> 00:09:19.240
I've decided.

00:09:19.400 --> 00:09:20.480
We're not waiting anymore.

00:09:20.480 --> 00:09:22.600
Some of us will blend in with the civilians,

00:09:22.600 --> 00:09:24.840
while the rest ambush them from around.

00:09:26.280 --> 00:09:27.560
In our first wave of attack,

00:09:27.560 --> 00:09:29.040
we take down their machine guns first

00:09:29.040 --> 00:09:31.120
and seize them for ourselves.

00:09:31.760 --> 00:09:33.360
This time fighting the Japs,

00:09:33.400 --> 00:09:34.160
it's not about winning or losing.

00:09:34.160 --> 00:09:35.690
We just want their weapons.

00:09:35.840 --> 00:09:36.440
Of course,

00:09:36.520 --> 00:09:38.320
the more Japs we kill, the better.

00:09:38.320 --> 00:09:40.320
That way, they won't dare enter the village so casually next time

00:09:40.320 --> 00:09:41.580
to harm the civilians.

00:09:42.280 --> 00:09:43.320
We hit them and run.

00:09:43.320 --> 00:09:44.200
This is a pit courtyard.

00:09:44.200 --> 00:09:45.360
It extends in all directions.

00:09:45.360 --> 00:09:47.320
Everyone hide in the tunnels in time.

00:09:47.320 --> 00:09:48.320
As long as you have a chance to escape,

00:09:48.320 --> 00:09:50.280
run back here to regroup immediately.

00:09:50.280 --> 00:09:51.600
Did everyone understand?

00:09:51.600 --> 00:09:52.600
Understood.

00:09:53.320 --> 00:09:54.800
Sixth Master, Ying.

00:09:55.280 --> 00:09:56.520
You guys guard this place

00:09:56.520 --> 00:09:58.160
and cover everyone coming back.

00:09:58.160 --> 00:09:59.020
Look, brother,

00:09:59.040 --> 00:10:00.360
don't underestimate me.

00:10:00.360 --> 00:10:02.690
I'll definitely show you my skills today.

00:10:02.880 --> 00:10:03.940
Let us go together.

00:10:03.960 --> 00:10:04.920
There is strength in numbers.

00:10:04.920 --> 00:10:05.640
Yeah.

00:10:09.400 --> 00:10:10.280
Alright.

00:10:10.760 --> 00:10:13.040
But you must obey orders during the operation.

00:10:13.040 --> 00:10:13.760
Okay.

00:10:15.880 --> 00:10:16.880
Everyone, get ready.

00:10:16.880 --> 00:10:17.410
Move out.

00:10:17.520 --> 00:10:18.240
Go.

00:10:22.400 --> 00:10:23.460
Fellow villagers.

00:10:24.000 --> 00:10:25.060
Fellow villagers.

00:10:26.040 --> 00:10:28.000
Don't fight them head-on.

00:10:28.320 --> 00:10:31.580
How about everyone goes back and prepares some more grain?

00:10:31.880 --> 00:10:32.680
Village Head.

00:10:32.880 --> 00:10:34.880
if we hand over this little grain,

00:10:35.160 --> 00:10:36.760
my whole family will starve to death.

00:10:36.760 --> 00:10:37.520
If we had grain,

00:10:37.520 --> 00:10:38.800
my mother wouldn't have starved to death.

00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:40.160
Since they're going to kill us anyway,

00:10:40.160 --> 00:10:41.360
just let them kill us.

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:43.130
Yeah, don't.

00:10:43.640 --> 00:10:44.360
Don't.

00:10:46.120 --> 00:10:47.880
Stop wasting your breath on them.

00:10:47.880 --> 00:10:48.720
Get ready.

00:10:58.760 --> 00:11:01.120
Fellow villagers, get down!

00:11:25.480 --> 00:11:26.320
Mr. Liu.

00:11:27.560 --> 00:11:28.440
Stop chasing!

00:11:30.440 --> 00:11:31.520
Don't prolong the fight.

00:11:31.520 --> 00:11:32.850
Quit while we're ahead.

00:11:38.920 --> 00:11:39.680
Catch.

00:11:40.480 --> 00:11:41.040
Retreat!

00:11:41.160 --> 00:11:41.880
Let's go.

00:11:52.080 --> 00:11:52.880
Keep up.

00:11:53.240 --> 00:11:54.000
Fire!

00:12:06.040 --> 00:12:07.640
Hit them hard!

00:12:21.920 --> 00:12:23.320
They're trying to surround us.

00:12:23.320 --> 00:12:25.280
Captain, they clearly have too many men.

00:12:25.280 --> 00:12:26.160
I know a small path in the back

00:12:26.160 --> 00:12:27.640
that goes around to the county town.

00:12:27.640 --> 00:12:28.520
Go back and report to the Colonel.

00:12:28.520 --> 00:12:29.400
Go.

00:12:31.560 --> 00:12:32.480
Say it again.

00:12:33.160 --> 00:12:34.680
Initial estimates suggest

00:12:34.680 --> 00:12:36.410
they have a division of troops.

00:12:36.440 --> 00:12:38.200
They are attempting to surround us.

00:12:38.200 --> 00:12:39.930
If I hadn't fought to break out,

00:12:40.280 --> 00:12:42.520
I would have already died for the Emperor.

00:12:42.520 --> 00:12:43.320
Bastard!

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:44.960
Get out!

00:12:45.360 --> 00:12:46.200
Yes, yes.

00:12:56.840 --> 00:12:57.800
Colonel.

00:12:59.080 --> 00:13:01.320
I heard we were ambushed.

00:13:02.040 --> 00:13:03.600
We suffered heavy losses.

00:13:04.040 --> 00:13:06.520
So I asked you here to discuss it.

00:13:06.920 --> 00:13:09.040
We need to teach them a lesson.

00:13:16.760 --> 00:13:17.720
Colonel.

00:13:18.080 --> 00:13:19.480
Now you know how cunning

00:13:19.480 --> 00:13:21.120
these Chinese are, don't you?

00:13:21.120 --> 00:13:23.120
You have clearly occupied this place,

00:13:23.120 --> 00:13:25.160
but you have to face the fact

00:13:25.520 --> 00:13:26.960
that you will coexist with them.

00:13:26.960 --> 00:13:28.640
They are in the dark, and you are in the light.

00:13:28.640 --> 00:13:30.200
You will never catch them,

00:13:30.560 --> 00:13:33.240
but they hit you with perfect accuracy.

00:13:34.240 --> 00:13:37.080
Tahara, you really understand them.

00:13:37.440 --> 00:13:39.840
I've been dealing with them for a long time.

00:13:40.960 --> 00:13:43.400
Then who did it this time?

00:13:44.360 --> 00:13:45.880
If I'm not mistaken,

00:13:46.080 --> 00:13:47.640
it should be led by the commander of the Independent Brigade,

00:13:47.640 --> 00:13:49.120
Cui Wenkui.

00:13:50.000 --> 00:13:52.280
He was the one supervising the construction of that airport.

00:13:52.280 --> 00:13:54.080
Later, Zhang Gongyan came.

00:13:54.400 --> 00:13:57.120
That guy embezzled a lot of money from the airport,

00:13:57.120 --> 00:13:59.400
so the airport was delayed.

00:14:01.120 --> 00:14:03.640
Now the airport is occupied by the Empire,

00:14:03.920 --> 00:14:06.380
and those bandits have been scattered by us.

00:14:06.600 --> 00:14:08.860
I will definitely report to my superiors

00:14:08.920 --> 00:14:12.050
and recommend you for promotion to Lieutenant Colonel.

00:14:14.240 --> 00:14:15.560
Thank you, Colonel.

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:18.720
Did you add the sentries?

00:14:19.000 --> 00:14:20.400
We set up three layers of sentries.

00:14:20.400 --> 00:14:21.960
As soon as they see the Japanese coming out,

00:14:21.960 --> 00:14:23.840
they will send up a smoke signal.

00:14:25.800 --> 00:14:26.680
Not bad.

00:14:26.960 --> 00:14:28.480
You learn fast.

00:14:29.480 --> 00:14:30.920
The methods of these swordsmen

00:14:30.920 --> 00:14:32.920
are sometimes quite effective.

00:14:33.560 --> 00:14:36.360
But we really stirred up a hornet's nest this time.

00:14:36.480 --> 00:14:38.120
The Japs will definitely retaliate.

00:14:38.120 --> 00:14:39.160
Be prepared.

00:14:39.720 --> 00:14:41.680
Cai Baozi got off easy this time.

00:14:42.080 --> 00:14:43.320
He just hit and ran.

00:14:43.520 --> 00:14:46.080
Now the Japs are coming after us.

00:14:46.800 --> 00:14:47.840
You shouldn't say that.

00:14:47.840 --> 00:14:49.200
Who's talking about me?

00:14:54.040 --> 00:14:56.480
Brigadier Cui, look what I've brought you.

00:15:06.520 --> 00:15:07.360
That's it?

00:15:09.360 --> 00:15:10.360
You're generous.

00:15:12.160 --> 00:15:13.000
Sit down.

00:15:19.920 --> 00:15:20.840
Brigadier Cui.

00:15:21.240 --> 00:15:22.720
We both get what we need.

00:15:23.040 --> 00:15:24.370
Neither of us loses out.

00:15:25.160 --> 00:15:25.880
What?

00:15:26.200 --> 00:15:27.600
Don't be too greedy.

00:15:27.920 --> 00:15:29.650
You want both fame and fortune?

00:15:29.840 --> 00:15:32.480
Now the whole world is talking about you, Cui Wenkui,

00:15:32.480 --> 00:15:34.740
giving the Japanese army a head-on blow.

00:15:34.920 --> 00:15:35.800
You see,

00:15:36.080 --> 00:15:37.280
the newspapers in the rear

00:15:37.280 --> 00:15:38.920
will definitely boast about you.

00:15:38.920 --> 00:15:39.920
All the credit

00:15:40.320 --> 00:15:42.000
goes to you, Cui Wenkui.

00:15:42.320 --> 00:15:43.960
What else do you have to lose?

00:15:44.280 --> 00:15:45.040
Besides,

00:15:45.360 --> 00:15:47.200
especially after Zhang Gongyan left,

00:15:47.200 --> 00:15:48.600
you won a great victory.

00:15:48.880 --> 00:15:51.540
You really got a bargain and still act innocent.

00:15:52.840 --> 00:15:54.040
Let me see your mouth.

00:15:54.040 --> 00:15:56.520
How come you're getting sharper and sharper?

00:15:56.520 --> 00:15:57.250
Just tell me,

00:15:57.520 --> 00:15:58.580
coming to my place,

00:15:58.680 --> 00:16:00.880
what other bargain do you want me to get?

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:06.000
It's no longer safe

00:16:06.000 --> 00:16:07.360
for you to be stationed here.

00:16:07.360 --> 00:16:09.080
If the Japanese army spots you,

00:16:09.080 --> 00:16:10.440
they'll attack you sooner or later.

00:16:10.440 --> 00:16:12.880
You'd better relocate as soon as possible.

00:16:13.720 --> 00:16:13.880
Fangmin, Cai Zhongkui

00:16:13.880 --> 00:16:16.210
So you do know how to worry about my safety.

00:16:16.520 --> 00:16:17.680
Jokes aside,

00:16:18.960 --> 00:16:20.760
I'm talking serious business with you now.

00:16:20.760 --> 00:16:22.960
Tell me, what intelligence do you have?

00:16:23.000 --> 00:16:24.880
Based on my understanding of the Japanese,

00:16:24.880 --> 00:16:26.960
they will eliminate any resistance

00:16:27.240 --> 00:16:28.280
one by one.

00:16:28.800 --> 00:16:30.360
Right now, the swordsmen's strongholds

00:16:30.360 --> 00:16:31.890
have mostly been wiped out.

00:16:32.000 --> 00:16:35.130
Your Nationalist force is the only one left in Shanzhou.

00:16:35.400 --> 00:16:36.360
Think about it.

00:16:36.720 --> 00:16:38.280
Even if you don't attack them,

00:16:38.280 --> 00:16:39.960
they will attack you.

00:16:40.840 --> 00:16:42.000
What's your trick?

00:16:44.400 --> 00:16:45.840
You know me well.

00:16:46.360 --> 00:16:47.120
Exactly.

00:16:47.600 --> 00:16:48.520
I think,

00:16:49.040 --> 00:16:50.840
rather than sitting here waiting to die,

00:16:50.840 --> 00:16:52.680
we should take the initiative

00:16:53.080 --> 00:16:54.720
to disrupt the Japanese army's plans.

00:16:54.720 --> 00:16:56.400
We need to lead them by the nose.

00:16:56.400 --> 00:16:57.960
We can't always be passive

00:16:58.200 --> 00:16:59.460
and follow their lead.

00:17:02.320 --> 00:17:03.200
Be specific.

00:17:04.280 --> 00:17:05.200
In Mageta Village,

00:17:05.200 --> 00:17:07.400
you made the enemies suffer in silence.

00:17:10.119 --> 00:17:11.200
It was us.

00:17:12.599 --> 00:17:13.480
Same thing.

00:17:14.040 --> 00:17:16.040
The enemies will definitely retaliate wildly.

00:17:16.040 --> 00:17:18.560
Instead of staying here to fight a positional war with them,

00:17:18.560 --> 00:17:20.599
we might as well take the initiative to attack.

00:17:20.599 --> 00:17:22.060
Attack their weak points,

00:17:22.280 --> 00:17:23.810
and hit them where it hurts.

00:17:24.760 --> 00:17:25.680
Yongbaodunian sanshisan guomin caozhong.

00:17:25.680 --> 00:17:27.040
Why are you so talkative today?

00:17:27.040 --> 00:17:28.369
Just tell me the target.

00:17:28.840 --> 00:17:29.900
Straightforward.

00:17:31.720 --> 00:17:32.980
Qinglong Stronghold.

00:17:35.520 --> 00:17:36.780
Qinglong Stronghold?

00:17:42.880 --> 00:17:44.640
Why are you so sure

00:17:45.480 --> 00:17:47.140
that I, Cui Wenkui, will agree

00:17:47.360 --> 00:17:49.280
to attack Qinglong Stronghold with you?

00:17:49.280 --> 00:17:50.940
We've gathered intelligence

00:17:51.480 --> 00:17:53.400
that Masao Tahara is in Qinglong Stronghold,

00:17:53.400 --> 00:17:55.530
hoarding a lot of food and ammunition.

00:17:55.600 --> 00:17:57.000
Moreover, this location

00:17:57.080 --> 00:17:58.740
controls three major routes.

00:17:59.680 --> 00:18:02.840
If the National Army counterattacks Shanzhou one day,

00:18:03.240 --> 00:18:05.080
the threat of Qinglong Stronghold

00:18:05.080 --> 00:18:06.210
must be eliminated.

00:18:06.960 --> 00:18:08.400
You just said it yourself.

00:18:08.400 --> 00:18:11.760
Masao Tahara is personally stationed in Qinglong Stronghold,

00:18:11.760 --> 00:18:13.220
and they have ammunition.

00:18:14.160 --> 00:18:15.960
What are our chances of winning?

00:18:16.320 --> 00:18:19.120
We can lure Masao Tahara out first.

00:18:20.280 --> 00:18:21.880
As for Qinglong Stronghold,

00:18:23.160 --> 00:18:24.400
we have our own ways.

00:18:25.520 --> 00:18:27.440
It won't be hard to break in.

00:18:41.120 --> 00:18:41.880
Sir.

00:18:42.680 --> 00:18:44.960
Cui Wenkui usually seems quite smart.

00:18:45.520 --> 00:18:46.640
But at the critical moment,

00:18:46.640 --> 00:18:48.970
you are the one who shows true leadership.

00:18:49.160 --> 00:18:50.760
Mr. Liu, you flatter me.

00:18:51.800 --> 00:18:52.880
For this matter,

00:18:53.280 --> 00:18:54.960
I will still need your great help.

00:18:54.960 --> 00:18:55.840
Me?

00:18:57.440 --> 00:18:58.360
No problem.

00:18:58.800 --> 00:18:59.840
Let's hurry up.

00:19:00.160 --> 00:19:02.360
We still have a lot to discuss when we get back.

00:19:02.360 --> 00:19:03.120
Okay.

00:19:11.560 --> 00:19:13.880
I have conveyed all the superiors' instructions to you.

00:19:13.880 --> 00:19:15.540
You know what to do now, right?

00:19:17.280 --> 00:19:19.240
Secretary Peng Tao's instructions on uniting

00:19:19.240 --> 00:19:21.400
the remaining swordsmen of Sandaoyuan are very important.

00:19:21.400 --> 00:19:23.360
I feel much more confident now.

00:19:24.000 --> 00:19:26.000
Attacking Qinglong Stronghold this time

00:19:26.000 --> 00:19:26.660
can firstly

00:19:26.720 --> 00:19:27.650
give confidence

00:19:27.840 --> 00:19:29.370
to the swordsmen around us,

00:19:29.440 --> 00:19:30.240
and secondly,

00:19:30.320 --> 00:19:32.250
rally more swordsmen to our cause.

00:19:33.760 --> 00:19:35.200
Come, have some water.

00:19:36.000 --> 00:19:37.460
You've had a hard journey.

00:19:39.720 --> 00:19:40.850
How are your wounds?

00:19:41.160 --> 00:19:42.840
Miss, I'm fine now.

00:19:43.480 --> 00:19:45.210
Thanks to Wenpei along the way.

00:19:45.480 --> 00:19:46.600
She helped take out the bullet

00:19:46.600 --> 00:19:47.930
and took good care of me.

00:19:48.480 --> 00:19:49.560
Don't say that.

00:19:50.320 --> 00:19:53.250
If it weren't for me, you wouldn't have been injured.

00:19:55.840 --> 00:19:59.080
Alright. The trip was not in vain.

00:19:59.440 --> 00:20:00.900
You came back just in time.

00:20:01.040 --> 00:20:01.720
Perfect.

00:20:02.040 --> 00:20:04.560
Let's study my plan carefully again

00:20:04.960 --> 00:20:06.890
and see if there are any loopholes.

00:20:07.960 --> 00:20:08.680
Look here.

00:20:09.000 --> 00:20:10.060
This is the armory.

00:20:10.480 --> 00:20:12.740
This is the gate of Qinglong Stronghold.

00:20:13.120 --> 00:20:15.400
How can we

00:20:15.760 --> 00:20:17.890
reach the armory in the shortest time?

00:20:21.440 --> 00:20:22.760
I received intelligence

00:20:22.760 --> 00:20:24.920
that the Japanese army's defense at the airport

00:20:24.920 --> 00:20:25.880
has been very weak lately.

00:20:25.880 --> 00:20:28.160
It's a good time to take it back.

00:20:28.440 --> 00:20:29.300
So I've decided

00:20:29.560 --> 00:20:31.920
to attack the airport soon

00:20:32.160 --> 00:20:33.620
and take back what we lost.

00:20:33.880 --> 00:20:34.940
Are you confident?

00:20:34.960 --> 00:20:35.960
Yes.

00:20:36.440 --> 00:20:37.240
Good.

00:20:37.880 --> 00:20:38.880
High morale.

00:20:39.960 --> 00:20:42.220
We can only win battles with high morale.

00:20:42.680 --> 00:20:45.000
Brigade Commander, beware of eavesdroppers.

00:20:45.000 --> 00:20:47.040
What are you muttering about? Speak up.

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:49.200
The Japanese secret police are everywhere.

00:20:49.200 --> 00:20:50.320
What are you afraid of?

00:20:50.320 --> 00:20:51.680
I'm going to fight back.

00:20:52.720 --> 00:20:53.880
Right turn,

00:20:54.400 --> 00:20:55.530
double time, march!

00:21:04.600 --> 00:21:06.120
Zhang Gongyan ran away.

00:21:06.480 --> 00:21:09.160
That is good news for us.

00:21:10.920 --> 00:21:13.720
I don't think it's good news.

00:21:15.160 --> 00:21:17.020
Zhang Gongyan is nothing to fear.

00:21:17.360 --> 00:21:19.890
He is the easiest type of Chinese to deal with.

00:21:20.400 --> 00:21:21.880
He saw us take the airport,

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:23.780
feared he'd be attacked next,

00:21:23.880 --> 00:21:25.410
so he slipped away quickly.

00:21:26.560 --> 00:21:29.080
Cui Wenkui is extremely difficult to deal with.

00:21:29.080 --> 00:21:31.120
He is an opponent of the Great Japanese Empire,

00:21:31.120 --> 00:21:32.160
a true diehard.

00:21:36.320 --> 00:21:37.160
Colonel,

00:21:37.600 --> 00:21:39.460
the spy you sent out has returned.

00:21:40.200 --> 00:21:40.800
Sir.

00:21:41.240 --> 00:21:43.800
They train every day, and their morale is high.

00:21:43.800 --> 00:21:46.400
It is said they are going to attack the airport.

00:21:46.400 --> 00:21:47.360
Do you know

00:21:47.640 --> 00:21:49.720
the consequences of providing false intelligence to the Imperial Army?

00:21:49.720 --> 00:21:52.000
If you dare to provide false intelligence,

00:21:52.000 --> 00:21:53.200
you will be beheaded.

00:21:53.320 --> 00:21:55.520
It is absolutely true. There is no mistake.

00:21:55.520 --> 00:21:58.980
He says it is absolutely true. There is definitely no mistake.

00:21:59.000 --> 00:21:59.520
You may go.

00:21:59.520 --> 00:22:00.280
Yes.

00:22:00.760 --> 00:22:01.440
Go.

00:22:04.240 --> 00:22:07.440
Tahara, do you think this information is reliable?

00:22:07.680 --> 00:22:09.760
I think it's highly credible.

00:22:10.120 --> 00:22:11.120
It matches the information gathered

00:22:11.120 --> 00:22:12.450
by the people I sent out.

00:22:14.400 --> 00:22:15.730
Attacking the airport?

00:22:16.960 --> 00:22:18.920
They really don't know their own strength.

00:22:18.920 --> 00:22:20.000
The Imperial Army

00:22:20.320 --> 00:22:22.560
is invincible.

00:22:23.080 --> 00:22:24.280
The Kuomintang's main forces

00:22:24.280 --> 00:22:26.200
were all beaten back by us.

00:22:26.560 --> 00:22:29.680
This small unit still wants to attack the airport.

00:22:30.120 --> 00:22:31.280
How ridiculous.

00:22:33.520 --> 00:22:34.480
Colonel.

00:22:35.040 --> 00:22:36.600
I have an idea.

00:22:37.040 --> 00:22:37.970
Please go ahead.

00:22:38.840 --> 00:22:41.000
Since they don't know their own strength,

00:22:41.000 --> 00:22:43.000
there's no need for us to show mercy.

00:22:43.480 --> 00:22:46.120
Aren't they planning to seize the airport?

00:22:46.600 --> 00:22:49.400
Then we won't even give them a chance to set off.

00:22:49.680 --> 00:22:51.240
We'll head straight for their base,

00:22:51.240 --> 00:22:52.920
uproot them,

00:22:53.320 --> 00:22:55.520
and catch them like rats in a trap.

00:22:57.240 --> 00:22:59.520
Brilliant. Absolutely brilliant.

00:23:00.200 --> 00:23:02.000
If they go to attack the airport,

00:23:02.040 --> 00:23:03.680
we'll raid their nest.

00:23:03.960 --> 00:23:05.120
We'll split into two groups

00:23:05.120 --> 00:23:07.380
and head straight for Lijiayao Village.

00:23:13.040 --> 00:23:13.920
Attention!

00:23:16.440 --> 00:23:18.500
Brigadier, everything is arranged.

00:23:22.680 --> 00:23:23.560
Once the sun comes up,

00:23:23.560 --> 00:23:25.000
have everyone else hide.

00:23:25.280 --> 00:23:26.000
Yes, sir.

00:23:26.560 --> 00:23:27.440
Tonight,

00:23:27.880 --> 00:23:29.960
we will make a forced march overnight.

00:23:29.960 --> 00:23:31.600
No lights and no noise.

00:23:31.800 --> 00:23:34.330
Violators will be dealt with by military law.

00:23:34.800 --> 00:23:35.530
Understood?

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:36.570
Understood.

00:23:36.680 --> 00:23:37.810
Prepare to move out.

00:23:38.160 --> 00:23:38.920
Target:

00:23:39.960 --> 00:23:41.220
Qinglong Stronghold.

00:23:41.680 --> 00:23:44.880
Brigadier, didn't you say we were attacking the airport?

00:24:07.520 --> 00:24:08.560
Has everyone remembered

00:24:08.560 --> 00:24:09.720
what I said?

00:24:10.160 --> 00:24:11.200
Got it. Got it.

00:24:11.480 --> 00:24:12.320
Good.

00:24:12.600 --> 00:24:14.530
I want to emphasize one more point.

00:24:14.600 --> 00:24:16.560
Follow orders in all actions.

00:24:16.880 --> 00:24:18.040
Okay, okay.

00:24:19.120 --> 00:24:19.880
Sir,

00:24:20.200 --> 00:24:21.320
we should go.

00:24:21.680 --> 00:24:23.400
Okay, let's go.

00:24:24.080 --> 00:24:24.610
Let's go.

00:24:24.760 --> 00:24:25.480
Let's go.

00:24:27.560 --> 00:24:29.840
I leave things at home to you.

00:24:31.120 --> 00:24:32.640
Please look after Xiaoni.

00:24:33.080 --> 00:24:34.000
Don't worry.

00:24:35.400 --> 00:24:36.530
Wait for our return.

00:25:05.960 --> 00:25:06.960
Stay alert, everyone.

00:25:06.960 --> 00:25:08.960
We are almost at Qinglong Mountain.

00:25:31.960 --> 00:25:32.840
Mr. Liu.

00:25:33.920 --> 00:25:35.180
What's the situation?

00:25:35.760 --> 00:25:37.090
The scouts ahead report

00:25:37.320 --> 00:25:38.840
that a troop is approaching.

00:25:38.840 --> 00:25:40.770
I guess it's Cui Wenkui and his men.

00:25:43.640 --> 00:25:44.840
They set off at night.

00:25:45.160 --> 00:25:47.220
They should arrive around this time.

00:25:48.160 --> 00:25:49.840
Ying'er, let's go greet them.

00:25:50.400 --> 00:25:51.860
Sixth Master, Master Liu.

00:25:52.000 --> 00:25:53.640
Please wait here for a moment.

00:25:53.640 --> 00:25:54.480
Okay.

00:26:09.160 --> 00:26:10.020
Commander Cui.

00:26:10.400 --> 00:26:11.760
We have been waiting for you.

00:26:11.760 --> 00:26:13.160
I also marched through the night.

00:26:13.160 --> 00:26:14.890
I didn't delay anything, did I?

00:26:15.120 --> 00:26:16.160
Right on time.

00:26:17.080 --> 00:26:18.010
Have your troops

00:26:18.200 --> 00:26:20.000
take a short rest in this forest.

00:26:20.560 --> 00:26:22.600
Let's discuss our attack strategy.

00:26:25.360 --> 00:26:26.560
Follow me, everyone.

00:26:45.560 --> 00:26:46.240
Halt.

00:26:54.800 --> 00:26:56.860
What's going on? Something's wrong.

00:26:57.360 --> 00:26:59.090
Something doesn't seem right.

00:26:59.200 --> 00:27:00.560
A military camp shouldn't be

00:27:00.560 --> 00:27:02.280
this quiet at this hour.

00:27:14.600 --> 00:27:16.440
In a moment, you'll lead the Nationalist army brothers

00:27:16.440 --> 00:27:18.160
and attack through the main gate of the stronghold.

00:27:18.160 --> 00:27:20.080
We will attack the stronghold through the secret passage

00:27:20.080 --> 00:27:22.480
and seize the armory directly.

00:27:25.760 --> 00:27:28.160
You're getting more and more calculating.

00:27:28.440 --> 00:27:30.120
You want me to lead my brothers

00:27:30.360 --> 00:27:31.760
and attack through the main gate.

00:27:31.760 --> 00:27:33.320
And you go through the secret passage?

00:27:33.320 --> 00:27:34.320
For use in the 33rd year of the Republic of China.

00:27:34.320 --> 00:27:36.180
The main gate has the most guards.

00:27:36.360 --> 00:27:37.690
Do you think I'm stupid?

00:27:38.200 --> 00:27:39.000
Cui Wenkui.

00:27:39.400 --> 00:27:41.400
Am I, Cai Baozi, that kind of person?

00:27:41.880 --> 00:27:43.400
The Japanese soldiers in the stronghold right now

00:27:43.400 --> 00:27:45.600
have all been taken out by Masao Tahara.

00:27:46.360 --> 00:27:47.880
They've all gone to your camp.

00:27:47.880 --> 00:27:49.010
Have you forgotten?

00:27:53.440 --> 00:27:56.240
The Empty Fort Strategy is set up for them.

00:27:56.560 --> 00:27:58.960
I don't know if the information is reliable or not.

00:27:58.960 --> 00:28:01.220
Don't worry, it's absolutely reliable.

00:28:01.240 --> 00:28:03.800
Uncle Banjin saw Masao Tahara early this morning

00:28:03.800 --> 00:28:05.930
leading his troops down the mountain.

00:28:06.080 --> 00:28:07.640
The remaining swordsmen in the stronghold

00:28:07.640 --> 00:28:08.760
won't put up much of a fight either.

00:28:08.760 --> 00:28:08.960
For use in the 33rd year of the Republic of China.

00:28:08.960 --> 00:28:11.840
With the two of us attacking from both the front and the shadows,

00:28:11.840 --> 00:28:14.360
how can we not take down Qinglong Stronghold?

00:28:14.360 --> 00:28:16.240
For use in the 33rd year of the Republic of China.

00:28:16.240 --> 00:28:17.560
For use in the 33rd year of the Republic of China.

00:28:17.560 --> 00:28:19.160
For use in the 33rd year of the Republic of China.

00:28:19.160 --> 00:28:20.040
It's a deal then.

00:28:20.040 --> 00:28:20.720
The spoils of war,

00:28:20.720 --> 00:28:21.520
half for each.

00:28:23.800 --> 00:28:24.560
Great.

00:28:35.560 --> 00:28:36.560
Empty.

00:28:41.240 --> 00:28:42.000
Bastards!

00:28:53.160 --> 00:28:54.160
Colonel.

00:28:54.840 --> 00:28:55.970
We've been tricked.

00:28:56.040 --> 00:28:57.440
Everyone has evacuated.

00:28:57.880 --> 00:28:58.760
Evacuated?

00:28:59.200 --> 00:29:00.160
When?

00:29:00.560 --> 00:29:02.040
Probably last night.

00:29:03.720 --> 00:29:05.000
Last night?

00:29:05.360 --> 00:29:09.160
Are they planning a sneak attack on my airfield?

00:29:11.240 --> 00:29:13.100
Judging by the distance and time,

00:29:13.240 --> 00:29:14.680
it shouldn't be the airfield,

00:29:14.680 --> 00:29:17.000
but my Qinglong Stronghold.

00:29:17.320 --> 00:29:18.400
Come with me.

00:29:34.240 --> 00:29:35.320
Keep up, those in the back!

00:29:35.320 --> 00:29:36.000
Okay!

00:29:36.760 --> 00:29:37.400
Keep up.

00:29:37.640 --> 00:29:38.240
Got it!

00:29:38.640 --> 00:29:40.170
Move faster and stay close!

00:29:54.160 --> 00:29:54.680
Platoon Leader Zhu.

00:29:54.680 --> 00:29:55.320
Yes, sir.

00:29:55.520 --> 00:29:57.000
Find a few men to guard the gate.

00:29:57.000 --> 00:29:58.120
The rest of you, follow me.

00:29:58.120 --> 00:29:58.840
Hurry up.

00:29:59.960 --> 00:30:00.680
Move.

00:30:01.120 --> 00:30:02.400
Everyone, get ready.

00:30:02.800 --> 00:30:03.600
Boss.

00:30:03.880 --> 00:30:05.040
Someone is attacking the stronghold.

00:30:05.040 --> 00:30:06.960
They've already reached the gate.

00:30:06.960 --> 00:30:08.040
Did you see who they are?

00:30:08.040 --> 00:30:09.370
It's the National Army.

00:30:09.400 --> 00:30:10.460
The National Army?

00:30:10.520 --> 00:30:12.120
What should we do, Boss?

00:30:13.040 --> 00:30:14.900
Don't panic. Let's go take a look.

00:30:29.480 --> 00:30:30.560
Put your guns down!

00:30:30.800 --> 00:30:32.000
Put your guns down!

00:30:32.920 --> 00:30:33.780
Drop your guns!

00:30:42.240 --> 00:30:43.500
Listen up, swordsmen.

00:30:43.840 --> 00:30:47.640
Your Miss Shangguan Ying is back!

00:30:48.600 --> 00:30:49.360
Brothers.

00:30:49.720 --> 00:30:51.360
I know you were forced.

00:30:51.880 --> 00:30:53.140
Put down your weapons.

00:30:53.360 --> 00:30:55.560
We won't make things difficult for you.

00:30:55.560 --> 00:30:56.440
Right.

00:30:57.040 --> 00:30:58.700
We only kill Japanese devils.

00:30:59.320 --> 00:31:01.120
If you refuse to be Chinese,

00:31:01.560 --> 00:31:03.820
and are willing to be Japanese traitors,

00:31:04.080 --> 00:31:06.340
then don't blame us for showing no mercy.

00:31:08.320 --> 00:31:09.480
Drop your guns.

00:31:09.880 --> 00:31:11.280
Put down your guns.

00:31:30.160 --> 00:31:31.420
Is everyone all right?

00:31:34.640 --> 00:31:36.160
Where is your boss?

00:31:38.760 --> 00:31:39.520
Speak.

00:31:39.800 --> 00:31:42.320
Master Liu, I saw him run that way.

00:31:46.120 --> 00:31:47.880
Ying, wait here.

00:31:55.360 --> 00:31:56.720
If that kid Tianyuan knew

00:31:56.720 --> 00:31:56.960
Issued in the 33rd year of the Republic of China.

00:31:56.960 --> 00:31:57.880
we tricked him,

00:31:58.280 --> 00:31:59.840
what expression would he have right now?

00:31:59.840 --> 00:32:01.320
Who cares about his expression.

00:32:01.320 --> 00:32:03.400
As long as we got Qinglongzhai back.

00:32:04.800 --> 00:32:06.240
We didn't come back this time

00:32:06.240 --> 00:32:07.920
to retake this place.

00:32:08.200 --> 00:32:10.400
Before Tianyuan Zhengxiong gets back,

00:32:10.440 --> 00:32:13.370
we need to find an opportunity to destroy this place.

00:32:13.880 --> 00:32:15.720
This is my father's life's work.

00:32:16.200 --> 00:32:17.040
Yinger.

00:32:17.800 --> 00:32:20.920
Qinglongzhai is no longer what it used to be.

00:32:21.480 --> 00:32:22.280
Its existence

00:32:22.400 --> 00:32:23.840
directly threatens the nearby

00:32:23.840 --> 00:32:26.370
anti-Japanese armed forces of the villages.

00:32:26.680 --> 00:32:28.160
I agree with Baozi.

00:32:28.640 --> 00:32:30.000
All right, let's not talk about this.

00:32:30.000 --> 00:32:31.800
We need to go to the armory first.

00:32:33.640 --> 00:32:35.800
Master Liu, take us there.

00:32:38.640 --> 00:32:40.900
Cui Wenkui, have your men guard the gates

00:32:41.080 --> 00:32:42.600
in case Tianyuan Zhengxiong comes back.

00:32:42.600 --> 00:32:44.880
You don't need to tell me. It's already arranged.

00:32:44.880 --> 00:32:45.720
First Squad Leader!

00:32:45.720 --> 00:32:46.240
Here!

00:32:46.440 --> 00:32:48.640
Get the men to seal all the gates.

00:32:48.840 --> 00:32:49.640
Yes, sir.

00:32:50.040 --> 00:32:50.880
Follow me.

00:32:51.400 --> 00:32:52.200
Let's go.

00:32:53.640 --> 00:32:54.400
Let's go.

00:32:59.960 --> 00:33:00.720
Let's go.

00:33:14.760 --> 00:33:15.600
Keep up.

00:33:31.320 --> 00:33:33.240
The Jap's armory is right here.

00:33:40.000 --> 00:33:42.060
It really is an inconspicuous place.

00:33:42.800 --> 00:33:44.320
This is a deserted courtyard.

00:33:44.320 --> 00:33:45.920
There was a fire here back then,

00:33:45.920 --> 00:33:47.980
and the whole family burned to death.

00:33:48.640 --> 00:33:51.040
The people in the stronghold thought it was unlucky,

00:33:51.040 --> 00:33:52.700
so they sealed this place off.

00:33:53.640 --> 00:33:55.720
Tianyuan sure knows how to pick a spot.

00:33:55.720 --> 00:33:56.840
In this godforsaken place,

00:33:56.840 --> 00:33:57.920
who could find it?

00:33:59.080 --> 00:33:59.880
Quite a lot of stock.

00:33:59.880 --> 00:34:01.440
Enough for us to use for a while.

00:34:01.440 --> 00:34:02.200
Yeah.

00:34:04.480 --> 00:34:06.840
What do you mean enough for you to use for a while?

00:34:06.840 --> 00:34:08.440
Didn't we agree on half each?

00:34:08.480 --> 00:34:09.210
Don't worry.

00:34:09.360 --> 00:34:11.080
A promise is a promise.

00:34:11.320 --> 00:34:12.580
You'll get your share.

00:34:18.719 --> 00:34:19.179
Report.

00:34:19.280 --> 00:34:19.880
What is it?

00:34:19.880 --> 00:34:21.159
Brigade Commander, the Japanese are attacking.

00:34:21.159 --> 00:34:24.620
They came in large numbers. We've suffered heavy casualties.

00:34:24.840 --> 00:34:25.920
What about the weapons?

00:34:25.920 --> 00:34:27.120
Take as much as we can.

00:34:27.159 --> 00:34:28.880
Blow up whatever we can't take.

00:34:28.880 --> 00:34:29.760
Okay.

00:34:31.080 --> 00:34:32.440
Brothers, hurry!

00:34:37.840 --> 00:34:39.080
Only take the good stuff.

00:34:39.080 --> 00:34:39.960
Hurry up!

00:34:43.880 --> 00:34:44.679
Hurry!

00:34:45.080 --> 00:34:45.920
Careful!

00:34:46.679 --> 00:34:47.920
Brothers, hurry!

00:34:48.280 --> 00:34:49.080
Baozi!

00:34:55.120 --> 00:34:55.920
Go!

00:35:05.840 --> 00:35:07.160
The armory!

00:35:08.040 --> 00:35:09.640
They blew up my armory!

00:35:10.000 --> 00:35:11.040
Bastards!

00:35:26.560 --> 00:35:28.360
Don't move. Behave.

00:35:29.760 --> 00:35:30.560
Come on!

00:35:35.080 --> 00:35:36.840
Platoon Leader Zhu, what's the situation?

00:35:36.840 --> 00:35:38.840
Brigade Commander, casualties are too high.

00:35:38.840 --> 00:35:40.700
We can't keep fighting like this.

00:35:41.120 --> 00:35:41.920
Hold them off!

00:35:42.040 --> 00:35:42.720
Yes, sir!

00:35:46.280 --> 00:35:47.200
Master Liu!

00:35:47.880 --> 00:35:49.880
Go, follow me to the secret passage.

00:35:51.120 --> 00:35:52.560
Retreat!

00:35:52.760 --> 00:35:53.640
Retreat!

00:35:54.080 --> 00:35:54.720
Hurry!

00:35:59.480 --> 00:36:00.320
Hurry up!

00:36:03.440 --> 00:36:04.240
Keep up.

00:36:04.520 --> 00:36:05.240
Hurry!

00:36:05.720 --> 00:36:06.440
Take this.

00:36:07.320 --> 00:36:08.480
Hurry, keep up!

00:36:08.920 --> 00:36:09.640
This way.

00:36:10.000 --> 00:36:10.600
Where?

00:36:10.880 --> 00:36:11.520
Hurry!

00:36:12.040 --> 00:36:13.160
Here!

00:36:16.320 --> 00:36:17.040
Keep up.

00:36:17.360 --> 00:36:18.400
Keep up, hurry!

00:36:23.600 --> 00:36:24.400
Hurry!

00:36:29.400 --> 00:36:30.400
Keep up!

00:36:33.720 --> 00:36:35.840
Son-in-law, you take Ying'er and go first.

00:36:35.840 --> 00:36:37.560
Master Liu, you lead everyone to retreat first.

00:36:37.560 --> 00:36:38.420
I'll cover you.

00:36:38.600 --> 00:36:40.320
I know the secret passage better than you.

00:36:40.320 --> 00:36:41.840
If you don't go, Ying'er won't go either.

00:36:41.840 --> 00:36:42.700
Hurry up and go!

00:36:42.960 --> 00:36:44.000
Master Liu!

00:36:44.520 --> 00:36:45.400
Master Liu!

00:36:46.240 --> 00:36:48.080
Baozi, tell Uncle Banjin to leave right now.

00:36:48.080 --> 00:36:48.940
Hurry up and go!

00:36:54.320 --> 00:36:55.440
Hurry up and go!

00:36:56.440 --> 00:36:58.200
Little Japs!

00:37:33.320 --> 00:37:34.040
Yes, sir!

00:38:03.840 --> 00:38:04.960
Brother,

00:38:06.040 --> 00:38:07.600
I'm coming to join you.

00:38:08.040 --> 00:38:09.080
Bastard!

00:38:24.760 --> 00:38:26.320
Bandage the wounds cleanly.

00:38:26.320 --> 00:38:28.120
The bones are fine. That's good.

00:38:31.080 --> 00:38:32.920
Uncle Banjin and Uncle Liu haven't caught up yet.

00:38:32.920 --> 00:38:34.250
Could they be in danger?

00:38:34.280 --> 00:38:35.120
Yes.

00:38:36.240 --> 00:38:37.560
Master Liu is familiar with the secret passage.

00:38:37.560 --> 00:38:39.280
Even if he encounters the Japs head-on,

00:38:39.280 --> 00:38:41.240
he should be able to get away safely.

00:38:41.240 --> 00:38:43.500
What I'm worried about now is Master Liu.

00:38:44.320 --> 00:38:45.160
Baozi.

00:38:47.960 --> 00:38:49.320
It's too close to the stronghold here.

00:38:49.320 --> 00:38:50.180
We need to move.

00:38:50.200 --> 00:38:52.000
Master Liu and Master Liu haven't come back yet.

00:38:52.000 --> 00:38:53.720
We want to wait for them a bit longer.

00:38:53.720 --> 00:38:55.050
Don't they know the way?

00:38:56.560 --> 00:38:57.440
How about this.

00:38:57.760 --> 00:38:59.560
You take the Nationalist brothers and withdraw first.

00:38:59.560 --> 00:39:01.890
Moving together makes too big of a target.

00:39:05.320 --> 00:39:06.120
That works too.

00:39:06.120 --> 00:39:07.760
But you absolutely cannot stay too long.

00:39:07.760 --> 00:39:09.240
The Japanese are very likely to counterattack.

00:39:09.240 --> 00:39:10.640
That would be bad for you.

00:39:12.440 --> 00:39:14.920
Wenkui, if you have nowhere to go,

00:39:15.240 --> 00:39:17.000
go to our underground courtyard.

00:39:17.000 --> 00:39:18.730
There is plenty of space there.

00:39:18.760 --> 00:39:19.440
Thanks.

00:39:19.640 --> 00:39:21.600
If I have nowhere to go,

00:39:21.600 --> 00:39:22.840
I will definitely bother you.

00:39:22.840 --> 00:39:24.240
You are welcome anytime.

00:39:25.440 --> 00:39:26.040
Take care.

00:39:26.080 --> 00:39:27.000
Stay safe.

00:39:27.680 --> 00:39:28.440
Platoon Leader Zhu.

00:39:28.440 --> 00:39:28.770
Here.

00:39:28.960 --> 00:39:29.800
Assemble the troops.

00:39:29.800 --> 00:39:30.360
Yes.

00:39:32.440 --> 00:39:33.400
He Xiaobian,

00:39:34.080 --> 00:39:36.440
you must give me an explanation today.

00:39:38.240 --> 00:39:39.120
Major.

00:39:40.360 --> 00:39:41.760
You took all the men away.

00:39:42.040 --> 00:39:44.080
There were only a few people left in the stronghold.

00:39:44.080 --> 00:39:45.400
It wasn't that we didn't want to fight,

00:39:45.400 --> 00:39:46.680
we were short of hands.

00:39:47.360 --> 00:39:50.360
Even if we wanted to fight back, we couldn't beat them.

00:39:51.600 --> 00:39:54.320
So you're saying it's my fault?

00:39:55.680 --> 00:39:57.080
I wouldn't dare say that.

00:39:57.880 --> 00:39:59.340
But I also find it strange.

00:39:59.720 --> 00:40:02.120
Why didn't they attack earlier or later,

00:40:02.560 --> 00:40:04.360
but exactly when you left with your troops,

00:40:04.360 --> 00:40:06.360
they came to attack the stronghold?

00:40:07.760 --> 00:40:10.090
Isn't it obvious that it was all arranged?

00:40:13.960 --> 00:40:15.920
Bring the captured man up here.

00:40:21.760 --> 00:40:23.880
He Xiaobian.

00:40:25.000 --> 00:40:28.000
You ungrateful son of a bitch.

00:40:28.880 --> 00:40:30.480
The boss trusted you so much,

00:40:30.800 --> 00:40:33.520
but little did he know he was raising a wolf.

00:40:34.520 --> 00:40:36.650
Not only did you bite the boss to death,

00:40:37.160 --> 00:40:40.440
you also handed Qinglong Stronghold to the Japanese.

00:40:41.520 --> 00:40:44.200
You son of a bitch.

00:40:44.400 --> 00:40:45.800
Are you even human?

00:41:12.840 --> 00:41:14.600
Don't you want to fight back?

00:41:15.240 --> 00:41:16.500
I'll give you a chance.

00:41:16.640 --> 00:41:17.520
Kill him

00:41:17.880 --> 00:41:19.280
and prove it to me.

00:41:19.760 --> 00:41:20.640
Come on.

00:41:21.120 --> 00:41:22.960
I'm not afraid.

00:41:25.200 --> 00:41:26.320
He Xiaobian,

00:41:26.760 --> 00:41:29.720
you are just a Japanese lapdog.

00:41:30.080 --> 00:41:32.040
Come on. Kill me.

00:41:39.160 --> 00:41:40.040
Major.

00:41:45.320 --> 00:41:46.840
You can't kill this man.

00:41:48.080 --> 00:41:50.280
Didn't you ask me to recruit swordsmen?

00:41:50.640 --> 00:41:52.040
This man is the sixth boss

00:41:52.040 --> 00:41:53.840
of the swordsmen in Sandaoyuan.

00:41:54.760 --> 00:41:56.620
Many people take orders from him.

00:41:57.360 --> 00:41:58.600
If we kill him,

00:41:59.360 --> 00:42:01.240
I'm afraid it will provoke public outrage.

00:42:01.240 --> 00:42:04.880
Keeping him alive can be useful to us.

00:42:09.520 --> 00:42:10.640
Are you confident

00:42:11.440 --> 00:42:13.300
in persuading him to listen to us?

00:42:15.200 --> 00:42:16.400
I know this man.

00:42:17.320 --> 00:42:18.920
He is all brawn and no brains.

00:42:19.800 --> 00:42:20.960
I have my own ways.